# Support Ticket Auto-Response Templates

## 1. Order Status Queries
**Triggers:** "Where is my order?", "Has this shipped yet?"  
**Response Template:**  
> "Hi {{customer_name}}, thanks for reaching out! Your order **#{{order_id}}** is currently **{{order_status}}**. Track your shipment live here: {{tracking_link}}. Let us know if you need anything else!"

## 2. Return & Refund Queries
**Triggers:** "How do I return this?", "When will I get my refund?"  
**Response Template:**  
> "Hi {{customer_name}}, returns are easy! Items in original condition can be returned within 30 days of delivery. Click here to generate your prepaid return label: {{return_portal_link}}. Once received, refunds take 3–5 business days to process."

## 3. Stock Availability Queries
**Triggers:** "Is this back in stock?", "Do you have this in another size?"  
**Response Template:**  
> "Hello! **{{item_name}}** in size **{{size}}** is currently out of stock. Estimated restock date is **{{restock_date}}**. Click [here] to set up an automatic email alert for when it returns!"
